{"ID":"20240206082126-xytdwdf","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206082126-xytdwdf","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206082126-xytdwdf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206082142-f6tqvc4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206082141-i8c4lcf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206082142-f6tqvc4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:339,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:339\u0026#125;","title":"草乌（草乌头、北乌头）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902164834"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206082142-f6tqvc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206082142-f6tqvc4","updated":"20240206082156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产黑龙江、吉林、辽宁、河北等地。\n【性状】\t草乌呈圆锥形而稍弯曲，形如乌鸦头，长27cm，直径13cm，顶端常有长1cm左右的残茎或茎痕，表面暗棕色或灰褐色，外皮皱缩。有的具突起的支根。质坚，难折断，断面白色或灰白色，形成层环纹多角形或类圆形。无臭，味辛辣，麻舌。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，热，有大毒。\n【功效】\t祛风除湿，温经止痛。用于风寒湿痹，关节疼痛，心腹冷痛，寒疝作痛，麻醉止痛。\n【炙品】\t制草乌：取净草乌，用凉水浸漂，每日换水2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3次，至口尝仅稍留麻辣感时取出，同甘草、黑豆加水共煮，以草乌熟透；内无白心为度，然后除去甘草及黑豆，晒至六成干，闷润后切片，晒干。 (每100斤草乌，用甘草5斤，黑豆10斤) 。\n【注解】\t“钉角”：指草乌周围呈瘤状突起的支根。"}]},{"ID":"20240206082140-q7h8va0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206082140-q7h8va0","updated":"20240206082140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206082140-zw1df6j.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724114126-5kkigee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724114126-5kkigee","updated":"20240724114242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 499px;","style":"width: 489px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草乌 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草乌 10-20240724114126-nt6l548.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 489px;\" parent-style=\"width: 499px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 534px;","style":"width: 524px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草乌 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草乌 11-20240724114242-m6pyxvu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 524px;\" parent-style=\"width: 534px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724112805-1xc8l23","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724112805-1xc8l23","updated":"20240724113508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 414px;","style":"width: 404px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草乌"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草乌-20240724112805-32bofct.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 404px;\" parent-style=\"width: 414px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 863px;","style":"width: 853px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草乌 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草乌 6-20240724113508-r8uhv9l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 853px;\" parent-style=\"width: 863px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724112900-oqoi8jo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724112900-oqoi8jo","updated":"20240724113837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 651px;","style":"width: 641px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草乌 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草乌 7-20240724113837-a003qoi.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 641px;\" parent-style=\"width: 651px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 627px;","style":"width: 617px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草乌 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草乌 2-20240724112900-6ydesw0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 617px;\" parent-style=\"width: 627px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724113337-al5zqx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724113337-al5zqx5","updated":"20240724113609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 608px;","style":"width: 598px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草乌 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草乌 3-20240724113205-g97w05d.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 598px;\" parent-style=\"width: 608px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 608px;","style":"width: 598px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Ty